Hello <%= @user.name %>,

Someone asked to reset the password for your Comfy Zone account. If that was you, choose a new one here:

<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>

The link works for <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>, and only once.
If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email: your password stays as it is.
